<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>คลังบทเรียน A-Level คณิต & ฟิสิกส์</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary-math: #2563eb;
      --primary-physics: #059669;
      --bg-color: #f8fafc;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --text-main: #1e293b;
      --text-sub: #64748b;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-color);
      color: var(--text-main);
      padding: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      padding: 20px 0;
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .header p {
      color: var(--text-sub);
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .section-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9;
    }

    .math .section-title {
      color: var(--primary-math);
    }

    .physics .section-title {
      color: var(--primary-physics);
    }

    .lesson-list {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .lesson-item {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .lesson-link {
      display: block;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--text-main);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .math .lesson-link:hover {
      background-color: #eff6ff;
      border-color: #93c5fd;
      color: var(--primary-math);
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }

    .physics .lesson-link:hover {
      background-color: #ecfdf5;
      border-color: #6ee7b7;
      color: var(--primary-physics);
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }

    .chapter-num {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-sub);
      margin-right: 6px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="header">
    <h1>📚 คลังบทเรียน A-Level</h1>
    <p>คลิกที่ชื่อบทเพื่อเข้าสู่เนื้อหาบทเรียน</p>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    
