        <li class="lesson-item">
          <a class="lesson-link" href="https://korakod4028-maker.github.io/Set/sequences-and-series-alevel.html" target="_blank">
            <span class="chapter-num">10.</span> ลำดับและอนุกรม
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="lesson-item">
          <a class="lesson-link" href="https://korakod4028-maker.github.io/Set/calculus-alevel.html" target="_blank">
